ation, we need to convert predictions to binary (0 or 1)\n# Using a threshold of 0.5\ny_pred_binary = (y_pred >= 0.5).astype(int)\n\nprint("Predictions (first 10):", y_pred_binary[:10])\nprint("Actual values (first 10):", y_test[:10].values)\n```\n```markdown\nNow I\'ll calculate the accuracy score and format the output as required.\n```\n```python\n# Calculate accuracy score\naccuracy = accuracy_score(y_test, y_pred_binary)\nprint("Accuracy Score:", accuracy)\n\n# Round to 2 decimal places\naccuracy_rounded = round(accuracy, 2)\nprint("Rounded Accuracy:", accuracy_rounded)\n```\n```markdown\n[STEP GOAL]: Verify the results and create the FinalAnswerBlock with the required format.\n```\n```markdown\nI need to verify the model performance and ensure all requirements are met before finalizing the answer.\n```\n```python\n# Verify the model coefficients\nprint("Model coefficients:")\nfor feature, coef in zip(X_encoded.columns, model.coef_):\n    print(f"{feature}: {coef:.4f}")\n\nprint("\\nModel intercept:", model.intercept_)\n\n# Verify accuracy is within valid range (0.0 to 1.0)\nprint("\\nAccuracy validation:")\nprint(f"Accuracy: {accuracy_rounded}")\nprint(f"Is within range [0.0, 1.0]: {0.0 <= accuracy_rounded <= 1.0}")\n```\n```markdown\nNow I\'ll create the FinalAnswerBlock with the required format.\n```\n```markdown\n{\n  "final_answer_block": {\n    "question_id": 7,\n    "answers": {"prediction_accuracy": 0.78},\n    "format_targets": {"prediction_accuracy": "@prediction_accuracy[0.78]"},\n    "evidence": {\n      "source_columns": ["Survived", "Pclass", "Sex", "Age", "SibSp", "Parch", "Fare", "Embarked"],\n      "sample_size": 715,\n      "method": "Linear Regression with one-hot encoding for Sex and Embarked, 80/20 train-test split with random_state=42",\n      "oracle_evidence": {"feature_columns": ["Pclass", "Sex", "Age", "SibSp", "Parch", "Fare", "Embarked"], "target": "Survived", "split": "80% train, 20% test", "random_state": 42, "metric": "accuracy_sco